        "avatar": "https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/l7gsZHytFhX7e6em3v72hxcXZyw7eZwR2j74Xf8Mj-6FSpI3xtqqgXG2_NXYyaG882F4v0l61a7FHvOiE_3-FI_Ijd05ExRD0SZBkjXoPOm97nuJb-yfcL2_N-wbngwVnmcJdoSvvUwaHfi-aDxpe_sgjkx2qsAKNavJyS16r-B_Mz7M-e3FN-bhg-I9uOAP68DavKgoAeIW2moeum9QIThIOy4DTvulRDuoVlBDPkcj_zcoomwPAqGF6n09uK3K265TB5sWr5GP4T5MeWaORwUX9cm95dMoNF2pyZJkPvYjKPr8s55PMhmhRrAEWJe13tLuMXlQRn6eMSWVjIbxrw.jpg"
      },
      "sourceId": "ua:agroinnovationclub",
